      </article>

      <article class="job">
        <div class="job-head">
          <h3 class="job-title">Coordinator of Volunteers | Burning Man Project</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="job-meta">San Francisco Bay Area | Apr 2018 - Oct 2018</p>
        <ul class="bullets">
          <li>Scheduled and coordinated volunteer shifts for major event operations, serving as liaison between 100+ volunteers and headquarters staff</li>
          <li>Managed real-time schedule changes and requests during event, maintaining smooth operations through proactive communication</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="job">
